# Keep the showcase's workspace file tracked — it wires the
# workspace-linked runtime dependency for `pnpm dev` and is the
# same for every developer. Per-developer overrides can live in
# a sibling ui5-workspace.yaml under a different name via the
# `--workspace` CLI flag.
